('Bexar', 'offered', 'THIS PAYMENT PLAN IS AVAILABLE TO EVERY BEXAR COUNTY TAX PAYER! The Half-Payment Plan is available to all Taxpayers and Business Owners for both real estate and business personal property accounts.', 'https://www.bexar.org/DocumentCenter/View/25922/Payment-Plans', '{"quarter":{"url":"https://www.bexar.org/DocumentCenter/View/25922/Payment-Plans","quote":"Equal payments are due by: 1 st Half: November 30 th 2 nd Half: June 30 th AVAILABLE EVERY NEW TAX YEAR ON OCTOBER 1 st Search Your Account The Quarter-Payment Plan is available to qualified Residential Property Owners who have a Homestead Exemption and who also have a 65 or Over, Disabled Person, or Disabled Veteran Exemption ."},"prepay":{"url":"https://www.bexar.org/DocumentCenter/View/25922/Payment-Plans","quote":"The Pre-Payment Plan allows Homeowners and Business Owners without a mortgage escrow account to pre-pay their taxes in monthly installments through September 15 th of each tax year without penalty or interest."}}'::jsonb, '2026-11-05'::date),
